  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">숗<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">볟<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">해<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">활<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3JYu8Tkios?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">環境<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환곙`</rt></ruby> 뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative\">당<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">完成<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">완솅ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    wi-tioh-hoan-kièng boe-tàng-lai-oan-siéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">段<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">돨-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">永遠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">難忘<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">란뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">戀情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">롼졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hît-toa̰-yêng-oân-lan-bōng’e loan-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">孤單<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거ˉ돨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來到<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래ᄀᅷ`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">昔日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셱ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">海岸<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">해ˆ활ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kōr-toā̰-lai-kàu-siêk-rît&#8217;e hâi-hoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">景致<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">곙ˆ디</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶原<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">유꽌-</rt></ruby>야뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">改變<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">개ˆ볜</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kiêng-ti yu-goan-ya-bo-kâi-pien\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不平靜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">붇ˆ볭졩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">海湧聲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">해ˆ옝ˆ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pût-pieng-jiēng’e hâi-yêng-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">像<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不平靜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">붇ˆ볭졩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiṵ-gûn-pût-pieng-jiēng’e sīm-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">아<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離別<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리볟ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情景<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">졩곙`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ā li-piêt’e jieng-kièng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">浮<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">푸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">在<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">재-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眼前<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">깐ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    phu-jai-gân-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雖然<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一切<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">環境<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">환곙`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">造成<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">조솅ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sūi-rien-ît-che lông-si-hoan-kièng lai-jo-siéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">對<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">볜</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tùi-lì’e kâm-jiéng ya-si-bo-pien\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">永遠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">期待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기태ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà ya-yêng-oân-ki-thāi&#8217;tio\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幸福<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱헉</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">前程<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">졘뎽ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    làn&#8217;e hieng-hork’e jien-tiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby 